#!/bin/bash

# omarchy:summary=Xbox controller support on Ubuntu

cat <<'MSG'
Ubuntu's kernel already supports Xbox controllers over USB and Bluetooth (xpad driver);
there is nothing to install. Pair the controller with Super + Ctrl + B.

For rumble and battery reporting over Bluetooth the out-of-tree xpadneo driver can be
built from https://github.com/atar-axis/xpadneo (needs dkms and the kernel headers).
MSG
